<title>UK: EU raises low quality wheat import duty.</title>
<headline>EU raises low quality wheat import duty.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Saturday raise duties on transatlantic imports of low quality soft wheat to 67.69 Ecus a tonne from 62.42, European Commission figures showed.</p>
<p>Other grain import duties will remain unchanged.</p>
</text>
